invariant: INV-7
file: handshake_message.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: a resuming TRUST=webpki hello offers the ticket alone again, with
  no signature_algorithms and no server_certificate_type, which is the
  hello entry 47 wrote. dns.google refused every such hello with
  handshake_failure when cocuyo measured it on 2026-09-24, and
  bin/webpki_resume_test's mock server answers it the same way, so every
  resumption row objects, the declined-ticket rows with them.

--- old
    write_webpki_signature_algorithms(&w);
    write_cert_types(&w, cfg);
    if (cfg->psk != NULL) {
        write_pre_shared_key(&w, cfg);
    }
--- new
    if (cfg->psk == NULL) {
        write_webpki_signature_algorithms(&w);
        write_cert_types(&w, cfg);
    } else {
        write_pre_shared_key(&w, cfg);
    }
